%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5a584a25f7a2f6c23a420ed9d0c79f73, type: 3}
  m_Name: npc_brann
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: AthenHill.Runtime::AthenHill.NpcDefinition
  id: npc_brann
  displayName: Brann
  role: Salvage dealer
  entries:
  - node: first_visit
    requires: '!primer, !flag:brann_met'
  - node: report_ready
    requires: order:order_steady_hands, !reported, stage:Report
  - node: report_early
    requires: order:order_steady_hands, !reported
  - node: steady_gather
    requires: order:order_steady_hands, stage:Gather
  - node: steady_bench
    requires: order:order_steady_hands, stage:Fabricate
  - node: steady_fit
    requires: order:order_steady_hands, stage:Fit
  - node: steady_test
    requires: order:order_steady_hands, stage:TestFire
  - node: long_report
    requires: order:order_long_arm, !reported, stage:Report
  - node: long_gather
    requires: order:order_long_arm, stage:Gather
  - node: long_bench
    requires: order:order_long_arm, stage:Fabricate
  - node: orders
    requires: primer, !freeplay
  nodes:
  - id: long_report
    title: Rifle receiver
    text: A Warden receiver, off a gunner's rack. Bolt's still true. Give me alloy for the barrel and stock, filament for the charge path and nanite for the cell seat, and the bench will build the rest of it around this. Train your rifle hand before you carry it; it kicks harder than the pistol.
    choices:
    - id: bench
      label: Let's build it.
      next: 
      action: close
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
  - id: long_gather
    title: Long arm
    text: Ossa wants you on a long arm? Bring me a Warden receiver off the relay-knoll gunners, six alloy, three filament and four nanite grade. I can build a field rifle around it.
    choices:
    - id: leave
      label: I'll get them.
      next: 
      action: close
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
  - id: long_bench
    title: Long arm
    text: Receiver, alloy, filament, nanite. It's all here. Use the workbench behind me and fabricate the Field Rifle.
    choices:
    - id: leave
      label: Will do.
      next: 
      action: close
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
  - id: greeting
    title: Salvage
    text: Salvage. I buy what comes back over the Berms, strip it, and sell the parts that still work. What do you need?
    choices:
    - id: shop_722
      label: Show me what you trade.
      next: 
      action: shop
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
    - id: fabricator_460
      label: Let me use the bench.
      next: 
      action: fabricator
      requires: pistol
      setFlag: 
    - id: about_839
      label: Who are you?
      next: about
      action: 
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
  - id: first_visit
    title: Salvage
    text: 'Brann. This is Salvage: I buy what the machines out on the Berms leave behind, strip it, and sell what still works. You''ve no sidearm and nothing to sell yet. The Wardens issue arms at Ossa''s post beyond the market gate. Come back when the Berms have given you something.'
    choices:
    - id: shop_199
      label: Show me what you trade anyway.
      next: 
      action: shop
      requires: 
      setFlag: brann_met
    - id: about_839
      label: Who are you?
      next: about
      action: 
      requires: 
      setFlag: brann_met
    - id: close_361
      label: I'll be back.
      next: 
      action: close
      requires: 
      setFlag: brann_met
  - id: about
    title: Brann
    text: 'Ward runs on what comes back over the Berms. Servos, coils, charge cells: the depot out there used to make them. Now we pull them out of the machines that kept working after the people stopped. I pay fair for salvage, and my bench at the back is the best in Ward for turning it into something useful.'
    choices:
    - id: shop_722
      label: Show me what you trade.
      next: 
      action: shop
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
    - id: greeting_594
      label: Back to business.
      next: greeting
      action: 
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
    - id: close_93
      label: Later, Brann.
      next: 
      action: close
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
  - id: report_ready
    title: Steady Hands
    text: 'Ossa radioed ahead: said you cleared the depot nest. Let''s see the haul... a worker servo, still twitching. Good. A scrap pistol kicks like a mule; a grip built round that servo takes the kick out of it. The bench is at the back.'
    choices:
    - id: bench_how_373
      label: Show me the bench.
      next: bench_how
      action: 
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
    - id: shop_227
      label: Trade first.
      next: 
      action: shop
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
    - id: close_182
      label: Later.
      next: 
      action: close
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
  - id: report_early
    title: Steady Hands
    text: Ossa radioed ahead about you. Want a steadier grip on that pistol? I build them round a worker servo, and I'm out of servos. The worker droids at the old machine depot carry them, south along the service road. Bring one back with a couple of measures of scrap alloy and the bench is yours.
    choices:
    - id: depot_490
      label: Where's the depot?
      next: depot
      action: 
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
    - id: shop_722
      label: Show me what you trade.
      next: 
      action: shop
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
    - id: close_832
      label: I'll find one.
      next: 
      action: close
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
  - id: bench_how
    title: The workbench
    text: 'Pick the Stabilised Pistol Grip from the schematics and fabricate it: one servo, two measures of scrap alloy, five of tier-one nanites. Then fit it to the pistol at the same bench. Short of alloy or nanites? I sell both, and servos too if you''ve the credits.'
    choices:
    - id: fabricator_630
      label: Use the bench.
      next: 
      action: fabricator
      requires: pistol
      setFlag: 
    - id: shop_722
      label: Show me what you trade.
      next: 
      action: shop
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
    - id: close_132
      label: Thanks, Brann.
      next: 
      action: close
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
  - id: depot
    title: The machine depot
    text: Out through the market gate, past Ossa's post, then south along the service road. The old machine depot is where the worker droids nest. They drop servos when you put them down. Watch their clamps.
    choices:
    - id: shop_722
      label: Show me what you trade.
      next: 
      action: shop
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
    - id: close_832
      label: I'll find one.
      next: 
      action: close
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
  - id: steady_gather
    title: Steady Hands
    text: No servo yet? The worker droids at the depot carry them. Bring one back, with two measures of scrap alloy and some nanites, and the bench is yours.
    choices:
    - id: shop_722
      label: Show me what you trade.
      next: 
      action: shop
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
    - id: depot_490
      label: Where's the depot?
      next: depot
      action: 
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
    - id: close_93
      label: Later, Brann.
      next: 
      action: close
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
  - id: steady_bench
    title: Steady Hands
    text: 'That servo''s ready. Bench is at the back: fabricate the grip, then fit it to the pistol right there.'
    choices:
    - id: fabricator_630
      label: Use the bench.
      next: 
      action: fabricator
      requires: pistol
      setFlag: 
    - id: bench_how_676
      label: How does the bench work?
      next: bench_how
      action: 
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
    - id: close_93
      label: Later, Brann.
      next: 
      action: close
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
  - id: steady_fit
    title: Steady Hands
    text: That's a good grip. Fit it to the pistol at the bench before you walk out with it in your pocket.
    choices:
    - id: fabricator_630
      label: Use the bench.
      next: 
      action: fabricator
      requires: pistol
      setFlag: 
    - id: shop_722
      label: Show me what you trade.
      next: 
      action: shop
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
    - id: close_93
      label: Later, Brann.
      next: 
      action: close
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
  - id: steady_test
    title: Steady Hands
    text: Feels steadier, doesn't it? Take it out past the gate and put a few shots into something. Ossa won't believe it until she hears it.
    choices:
    - id: shop_722
      label: Show me what you trade.
      next: 
      action: shop
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
    - id: fabricator_460
      label: Let me use the bench.
      next: 
      action: fabricator
      requires: pistol
      setFlag: 
    - id: close_86
      label: On my way.
      next: 
      action: close
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
  - id: orders
    title: Salvage
    text: Ossa keeps sending schematics to my bench. Whatever she's after next, the bench is yours, and I'm buying whatever the Berms give up.
    choices:
    - id: fabricator_460
      label: Let me use the bench.
      next: 
      action: fabricator
      requires: pistol
      setFlag: 
    - id: shop_722
      label: Show me what you trade.
      next: 
      action: shop
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
    - id: close_93
      label: Later, Brann.
      next: 
      action: close
      requires: 
      setFlag: 
  shop:
    title: Salvage
    subtitle: "Brann \xB7 Parts and salvage"
    supplies: 0
    parts: 1
    salvage: 1
